<title>PHILIPPINES: ATI reaches foreign ownership limit.</title>
<headline>ATI reaches foreign ownership limit.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share ownership of port operator Asian Terminals Inc (ATI) had reached the statutory 40 percent foreign ownership limit, ATI stock transfer agent Far East Bank and Trust Co said on Friday.</p>
<p>ATI is partly owned by P&amp;O Ltd of Australia, which in turn is a subsidiary of P&amp;O Steam Navigation Co, and Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd.</p>
<p>ATI was untraded at 4.40 pesos in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
